      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1782524781100,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "decision_engine.py\nOperational truth surface.\n\nGates:\n- unresolved material event -> RESEARCH_REQUIRED\n- BUY_NOW requires thesis, valuation, sizing, anti-thesis, hedge, invalidation\n- ADD_ON_DIP requires bounded cause, approved protocol, improved valuation, no thesis damage\n- SELL requires named broken thesis or unacceptable risk\n- reported puts stay signal-only",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 177,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "decision_engine.py\nOperational truth surface.\n\nGates:\n- unresolved material event -> RESEARCH_REQUIRED\n- BUY_NOW requires thesis, valuation, sizing, anti-thesis, hedge, invalidation\n- ADD_ON_DIP requires bounded cause, approved protocol, improved valuation, no thesis damage\n- SELL requires named broken thesis or unacceptable risk\n- reported puts stay signal-only",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
